    "description": "Hoop World: Dunking Games\r\n\r\nHoop World: Dunking Games\r\nTHE ULTIMATE FLIP & DUNK GAME!\r\nJump and dunk your way through mind-bending portals in an epic adventure!\r\n\r\nHave you ever pulled off a triple front flip dunk while traveling through a portal to a new world? Hoop World is the ultimate, most addictive basketball game with the simplest controls and coolest graphics!\r\n\r\nPlaying is easy but mastering is not! Can you unlock all the exciting levels?\r\n\r\nHoop World: Dunking Games\r\nUnleash your basketball skills. Shoot hoops. Make mind-blowing slam dunks. Flip more for more points. Jump through rooftops, trampolines, slides and more. Be careful not to fall and break your neck! Complete your journey through amazing portals and discover super cool environments! \r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nHOW TO PLAY\u2028\r\n\r\nEasy to learn - 1 finger control:\r\n\r\nTap to Jump & Hold to Flip & Release to Dunk!\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nReady for your new addiction? It is Free to Play! \r\n\r\nHoop World by Tapped Ltd \u2013 DOWNLOAD NOW & ENJOY!\r\n\r\nPlease give us your feedback so we can improve our quality and experience according to your suggestions. We really appreciate your valuable feedback.\r\nContact us for support:\r\ncontact@quiet.fun\r\nVisit our website:\r\nhttps://www.quiet.fun/\r\nOur Privacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.quiet.fun/legal-notices/\r\nOur Social Media:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/company/quietgamesapp/mycompany/",
